Supports: Gaea (C5, C6, C7 direct head nodes), Hera, Ursa, Orion, Hercules.

SECURITY POSTURE (HPC Read-Only Access V1):
- STRICT APPLICATION-LEVEL READ-ONLY ACCESS CONTROL.
- ARBITRARY REMOTE SHELL COMMAND EXECUTION IS PERMANENTLY REMOVED.
- Minimal Read-Only API: only 'list', 'stat', and 'download' remote operations permitted.
- Background Daemon enforces protocol-level capability whitelist and default-deny.
- Separate socket namespace (~/.ssh/hpc_ro_{cluster}.sock) prevents legacy command collision.
- Remote operations use rigid templates with '--' option terminators and shlex.quote().
- PTY control characters are strictly rejected; valid path characters (spaces, Unicode) preserved.
- Local socket permissions: directory 0700, socket file 0600, peer UID verification.
- Download payload bounded at 50 MB with remote pre-check, memory bounds, and atomic file replacement.
"""

